I really hope the new place works out well. I don't like moving very much so I don't want to have to do it again,,

Oh and I also just landed a new job! It's at a coffee roasting plant. They have me doing the shipping and sometimes bagging the coffee. It's a lot better then working at the ups store. Right now I work at both places, but I'm hoping to fully transition to the coffee place soon. I'll miss a lot of things about the ups store. You meet a lot of interesting business people working there. Once I had a shipment going to Gabe Newel's yacht (I'm not kidding. It was dropped off by a regular customer who shipped high-end beauty products all the time). I've met a lot of business owners and CEO's, scientists shipping equipment, all sorts of stuff. That being said it's mostly people returning amazon items lol.

So many changes going on for me right now. I'm taking a leap of faith, wish me luck :)